    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fceb24c23aadbca951c9",
      "document_start": 106,
      "document_end": 175,
      "text": "压电式加速度传感器结构简单、牢固、体积小、质量轻，频率响应范围宽，动态范围大，性能稳定，输出线性好，使用温度范围以及抗外磁场干扰能力较强。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_fe58b98c96e90ea3826b",
      "document_start": 175,
      "document_end": 217,
      "text": "压电式加速度传感器的结构按压电晶体的工作方式可分为三种形式：压缩型、弯曲型和剪切型。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a0eccd63b4327813781e",
      "document_start": 217,
      "document_end": 253,
      "text": "其中压缩型又分为周边压缩式、中心压缩式、倒装中心压缩式和基座隔离压缩式。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d880fd93f950d3092f69",
      "document_start": 255,
      "document_end": 275,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_67642777e39c5706cbc0",
      "document_start": 276,
      "document_end": 288,
      "text": "# 3）加速度测试方法;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0d2004c5d779c2f1512b",
      "document_start": 289,
      "document_end": 321,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3aad52e50a051c248b33",
      "document_start": 323,
      "document_end": 357,
      "text": "压阻式加速度传感器利用半导体压敏电阻材料作为敏感元件测量振动加速度。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_00c9285dfaa8e55440f5",
      "document_start": 357,
      "document_end": 405,
      "text": "其低频响应好，具有测量零频响应的能力，灵敏度高、频响范围宽，其缺点是信噪比较低，受温度影响较大。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ab8e6dc32647762fcee3",
      "document_start": 407,
      "document_end": 427,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b55c0f0fd4375b77c7ab",
      "document_start": 428,
      "document_end": 440,
      "text": "# 3）加速度测试方法;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_24085655bc96b716320b",
      "document_start": 441,
      "document_end": 473,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7c6353c270e70cfc3345",
      "document_start": 475,
      "document_end": 502,
      "text": "应变加速度传感器利用电阻应变片作为敏感元件测量加速度。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b7107757a8a830157d4e",
      "document_start": 502,
      "document_end": 541,
      "text": "其结构简单、使用可靠、横向效应小，可以从零频测量开始，适用于低频振动信号测量。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d4f79de82c8db086540c",
      "document_start": 541,
      "document_end": 551,
      "text": "其缺点是灵敏度较低。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_190283124630a402fb01",
      "document_start": 553,
      "document_end": 573,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_29db3ff81adf32f58225",
      "document_start": 574,
      "document_end": 586,
      "text": "# 3）加速度测试方法;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7c632d1b03ccae3f6849",
      "document_start": 587,
      "document_end": 619,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_7b150f2a0db3aaf42ba3",
      "document_start": 621,
      "document_end": 645,
      "text": "电容式加速度传感器利用变电容敏感元件测量加速度。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2cdcb01bea2afebf8338",
      "document_start": 645,
      "document_end": 707,
      "text": "其尺寸小、重量轻、结构牢固，一般采用气体阻尼，内装有过量程限止器，具有零频响应、零位漂移量小、线性好、工作温度范围宽等特点。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_97b00ca0060d5e1785bb",
      "document_start": 709,
      "document_end": 729,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6353e7de9f719baa4663",
      "document_start": 730,
      "document_end": 742,
      "text": "# 3）加速度测试方法;",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b4b0ca8decd2be09927e",
      "document_start": 743,
      "document_end": 775,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ffd4a3b0d910f09bdeb0",
      "document_start": 777,
      "document_end": 839,
      "text": "测量微振动加速度可采用伺服式加速度传感器，其具有较高的分辨率和较高的灵敏度，有的内装有温度传感器，从而可进行环境温度标准化。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2518b54a85a944342aef",
      "document_start": 839,
      "document_end": 884,
      "text": "该类传感器非线性度低，频率响应宽，尺寸小、质量轻，不受湿度和温度影响，量程可调，结构牢固。",
      "section_id": "section_69878c707ad9"
    }
